=== 1. unquoted delim - parameter / cmdsubst / arith expand
hello world
result: computed
math: 6
literal-tilde: ~
=== 2. single-quoted delim - body is verbatim
hello $NAME
result: $(echo computed)
math: $((1 + 2 + 3))
=== 3. double-quoted delim - same as single (no expansion)
hello $NAME
=== 4. <<- strips ONLY leading tabs, not spaces
tab-indented (stripped)
double-tab (stripped)
    space-indented (kept)
mixed	tab	in	the	middle
=== 5. heredoc inside a function
greet for alice, count=42
=== 6. heredoc piped into another command
SHOUTING AT WORLD
=== 7. heredoc with backslash escapes
backslash-escape-of-dollar: $NAME
backslash-escape-of-backslash: \
backslash-other: \x
=== 8. heredoc redirected to a file then back
saved world
=== done
